 $Y$ is a $9\\times 9$ matrix and $det(Y)=75.$ The matrix $Z$ is obtained from $Y$ by applying the elementary row operations ${R}_{8}↔{R}_{9}$ and ${R}_{7}:={R}_{7}+\\frac{2}{5}{R}_{2}.$ What is the value of $det(Z)?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440484 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ba8abd45-3c22-5be5-a8a7-0f2c616dbcc7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440484 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's figure out what each operation does to the determinant.\n\n- The operation ${R}_{8}↔{R}_{9}$ involves swapping two rows, so it changes the sign of the determinant to the opposite one.\n\n- The operation ${R}_{7}:={R}_{7}+\\frac{2}{5}{R}_{2}$ involves adding a multiple of one row to another row,  so it does not change the determinant.\n\nTherefore, we only have to change the sign of the determinant to the opposite one. Consequently, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(Z) & =-det(Y) \\\\  & =-(75) \\\\  & =-75.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440485 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186440482 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440485 #edb/ref 1069 "q-72744" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440485 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440485 #edb/ref 1071 "Suppose $X$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix and $det(X)=-3.$ What is the value of $det(7X)?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440485 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fc497788-364d-5c29-8657-a4f1556e2704" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440485 #edb/ref 1074 "Multiplying a $n\\times n$ matrix by a scalar $k$ is equivalent to multiplying each row by $k,$ and this occurs $n$ times. This leads to the result\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(k\\cdot X)={k}^{n}\\cdot det(X).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have $k=7$ and $n=2.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(7X) & ={7}^{2}\\cdot det(X) \\\\  & =49\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-147.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440486 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0b56b3f3-0eed-5dd2-8e0f-81ffa9b89ff3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440486 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186378657 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440487 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440488 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440487 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1776f775-68f2-5dfe-9a78-5fcd889a28cc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440487 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186265972 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440488 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440488 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bc80a516-1dfa-5188-a931-81163ba5b5d8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440488 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186383216 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440489 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440489 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "dddee882-e3d5-5fc5-bf4f-fc432c1be973" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440489 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440484 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440490 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440489 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440490 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ea78220d-d076-5d61-804b-70c264ba0078" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186440490 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440485 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
